<title>UK: Asfinag sets NZ$100 million three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Asfinag sets NZ$100 million three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASFINAG AUTOBAHNEN-UND SCHNELLSTRASSEN FINANZIERUNGS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    17.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.545   PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/NZ/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
